# Release binaries — ~640 MB per version. They are staged here from
# ../Clew-app/out/ by `make stage-downloads` and uploaded by
# `make sync-downloads`. Git is the wrong place for them: they are
# reproducible from a tagged build, they would dwarf the rest of the
# history, and every future clone would pay for them forever.
